<div class="admin-top"><h1>Reports &amp; profit</h1></div>
<form class="filter-bar" method="get"><div class="field"><label for="from">From</label><input id="from" type="date" name="from" value="<%= from %>"></div><div class="field"><label for="to">To</label><input id="to" type="date" name="to" value="<%= to %>"></div><button class="btn btn-small">Show</button></form>
<% if (profit.isEstimate) { %><div class="alert alert-info"><strong>These profit figures are estimates.</strong> <%= profit.noCostLines %> sold item line(s) have no cost recorded, so their profit looks bigger than it really is. Record costs when you add sizes or receive stock.</div>
<% } else { %><p class="small">Profit figures are estimates based on the costs and expenses you have recorded. Anything not recorded is not included.</p><% } %>
<div class="grid-2"><div class="box"><h2>Profit estimate <a class="small" href="/admin/reports/export/profit?from=<%= from %>&to=<%= to %>">CSV</a></h2>
<table class="table"><tbody>
<tr><td>Product sales (<%= profit.orders %> paid orders)</td><td class="num"><%= ghs(profit.productSales) %></td></tr><tr><td>Less discounts given</td><td class="num">-<%= ghs(profit.discounts) %></td></tr>
<tr><td><strong>Net product sales</strong></td><td class="num"><strong><%= ghs(profit.netSales) %></strong></td></tr><tr><td>Less cost of goods sold</td><td class="num">-<%= ghs(profit.cogs) %></td></tr>
<tr><td><strong>Gross profit</strong> (margin <%= profit.grossMarginPct.toFixed(1) %>% · markup <%= profit.markupPct.toFixed(1) %>%)</td><td class="num"><strong><%= ghs(profit.grossProfit) %></strong></td></tr>
<tr><td>Add delivery fees collected</td><td class="num"><%= ghs(profit.deliveryFees) %></td></tr><tr><td>Less refunds</td><td class="num">-<%= ghs(profit.refunds) %></td></tr><tr><td>Less payment fees (Paystack)</td><td class="num">-<%= ghs(profit.paymentFees) %></td></tr>
<% profit.expenses.forEach(e => { %><tr><td>Less expense: <%= e.category %></td><td class="num">-<%= ghs(e.amount) %></td></tr><% }) %>
<tr><td><strong>Estimated net operating profit</strong></td><td class="num <%= profit.netProfit < 0 ? 'neg' : 'pos' %>"><strong><%= ghs(profit.netProfit) %></strong></td></tr></tbody></table>
<p class="small">Delivery costs you pay couriers are entered under Expenses → “Delivery costs”, so they are already included above. Stock purchases are not expenses until sold (they are in cost of goods).</p></div>
<div class="box"><h2>Cash view (not profit)</h2><table class="table"><tbody>
<tr><td>Payments collected</td><td class="num"><%= ghs(cash.collected) %></td></tr><tr><td>Less Paystack fees</td><td class="num">-<%= ghs(cash.fees) %></td></tr><tr><td>Less refunds paid</td><td class="num">-<%= ghs(cash.refunds) %></td></tr><tr><td>Less expenses paid</td><td class="num">-<%= ghs(cash.expenses) %></td></tr><tr><td>Less paid to suppliers</td><td class="num">-<%= ghs(cash.supplierPaid) %></td></tr>
<tr><td><strong>Net cash movement</strong></td><td class="num <%= cash.net < 0 ? 'neg' : 'pos' %>"><strong><%= ghs(cash.net) %></strong></td></tr></tbody></table>
<p class="small">Cash includes money for stock you have bought but not sold yet, so it is different from profit.</p>
<h2>Other</h2><p>Refunds: <%= refunds.c %> (<%= ghs(refunds.s) %>) · Cancelled orders: <%= cancelled.c %> (<%= ghs(cancelled.s) %>)</p>
<p>Stock value at cost: <strong><%= ghs(valuation.cost_value) %></strong> · at selling price: <%= ghs(valuation.retail_value) %></p>
<h2>Payment methods</h2><table class="table"><tbody><% methods.forEach(m => { %><tr><td><%= m.method %></td><td class="num"><%= m.orders %></td><td class="num"><%= ghs(m.amount) %></td></tr><% }) %></tbody></table></div></div>
<div class="box"><h2>Sales by product <a class="small" href="/admin/reports/export/products?from=<%= from %>&to=<%= to %>">CSV</a></h2><table class="table"><thead><tr><th>Product</th><th>Brand</th><th class="num">Units</th><th class="num">Revenue</th><th class="num">Cost</th><th class="num">Gross profit</th></tr></thead><tbody>
<% products.forEach(p => { %><tr><td><%= p.product_name %></td><td><%= p.brand_name %></td><td class="num"><%= p.units %></td><td class="num"><%= ghs(p.revenue) %></td><td class="num"><%= ghs(p.cogs) %></td><td class="num"><%= ghs(p.revenue - p.cogs) %></td></tr><% }) %><% if (!products.length) { %><tr><td colspan="6">No paid sales in this period.</td></tr><% } %></tbody></table></div>
<div class="box"><h2>Sales by category <a class="small" href="/admin/reports/export/categories?from=<%= from %>&to=<%= to %>">CSV</a></h2><table class="table"><tbody><% categories.forEach(c => { %><tr><td><%= c.category %></td><td class="num"><%= c.units %></td><td class="num"><%= ghs(c.revenue) %></td></tr><% }) %></tbody></table></div>
<div class="box"><h2>Price check: margin and markup per size <a class="small" href="/admin/reports/export/stock">CSV</a></h2><table class="table"><thead><tr><th>Product</th><th>Size</th><th class="num">Sells at</th><th class="num">Cost</th><th class="num">Gross profit</th><th class="num">Margin</th><th class="num">Markup</th></tr></thead><tbody>
<% margins.forEach(m => { %><tr><td><%= m.product %></td><td><%= m.label %></td><td class="num"><%= ghs(m.sell) %></td><td class="num"><%= m.cost ? ghs(m.cost) : 'not set' %></td><td class="num <%= m.grossProfit < 0 ? 'neg' : '' %>"><%= ghs(m.grossProfit) %></td><td class="num"><%= m.marginPct.toFixed(0) %>%</td><td class="num"><%= m.markupPct === null ? '–' : m.markupPct.toFixed(0) + '%' %></td></tr><% }) %></tbody></table>
<p class="small">Margin = profit ÷ selling price. Markup = profit ÷ cost. Remember payment fees, packaging and delivery also eat into this.</p></div>
<div class="box"><h2>Supplier balances <a class="small" href="/admin/reports/export/suppliers">CSV</a></h2><table class="table"><tbody><% balances.forEach(b => { %><tr><td><%= b.name %></td><td class="num">received <%= ghs(b.received_value) %></td><td class="num">paid <%= ghs(b.paid) %></td><td class="num"><%= ghs(b.owed) %> owed</td></tr><% }) %></tbody></table></div>
